      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">[By the name of] our Creator. [Buil]d and Prosper.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... of the we]ek(?), twenty-four in [Si]van, in the fifth year of the sabbatical cycle, which is year four thousand, eight\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[hundred ...] A.M. , in the city of Tyre, which is located on the shore of the great sea. There came before us this m(aster) Solomon, the youth\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[b. ...]mh (whose) s(oul is at) r(est), and he said, \"Intentionally, willingly, voluntarily, and of my own choice, not coerced, not vexed, not compelled, not\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... and not] intoxicated, but with (my) full senses and with clear speech, to [m]arry this Mub\u0101[raka(?) the bride,] the [virg]in, daughter of m(aster) Nathan, (may his) e(nd be) g(ood), b. Yeshu\u02bfa</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...to be] my companion and my wife in covenant. [And] I must este[em her, ...], provide for her, and fulfill her [n]eeds, in the manner of decent [Jewish] men</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[who \u2026] and honor, and pr[ovide for \u2026] their wives in purity and sanctity. I already have fixed for her as an obligation incumbent upon me</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[... of] the coins [of the state \u2026o]f which twenty(?) full gold dinars are the advanced mohar.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] full, as a d[ebt \u2026 She has no ri]ght to claim of them the value of a [sm]all pe[ru\u1e6da], as long as she is</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[under my jurisdiction, not thirs]ty, nor h[ungry ...\"] ... of [...]\u00a0 hate(?). And this girl has matured\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">[...] She has [appointed] m(aster) Natha[n b. Yeshu\u02bfa] (whose) s(oul is at) r(est), her father, to fulfill\u00a0\u00a0</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u2026 </li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
